      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">V</mtext><mo>'</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">V</mtext><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">a</mtext><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">t</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></math>",
